  "title": "Kristin's Turkey Butternut Squash Casserole",
  "description": "This ground turkey and butternut squash casserole recipe is topped with crushed crackers. It's a quick meal for busy weeknights to feed the family.",
  "authors": [
    "Kristin Ferguson"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-18T23:58:14-04:00",
